Package: sysklogd
Version: 1.5.1-r0
Description: System Log Daemons
 The sysklogd package implements two system log daemons: syslogd, klogd
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv2+ & BSD
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: sysklogd
Homepage: http://www.infodrom.org/projects/sysklogd/
Depends: update-alternatives-opkg, initscripts-functions, libc6 (>= 2.21)
Recommends: update-rc.d
